  "question": {
    "text": "A gas mixture consists of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> moles of argon and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> moles of oxygen at temperature <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>. Neglecting all vibrational modes, the total internal energy of the system is",
    "image": null
  },
